### API Deprecation

When deprecating APIs at the `presentation` layer, follow RFC 9745 (Deprecation header) and RFC 8594 (Sunset header).

**Required headers:**
- `Deprecation`: RFC 9745 date-time in Unix epoch timestamp when the endpoint was deprecated (e.g.) (e.g., `"@1688169599"` for June 30, 2023 at 23:59:59 UTC)
- `Sunset`: RFC 8594 date-time when the endpoint will be removed (e.g. `Sun, 30 Jun 2024 23:59:59 UTC` for Sunday 30, 2024 at 23:59:59 UTC)

**Implementation:**
- Use `@Header()` from `@nestjs/common` for HTTP headers
- Use `@ApiOperation({ deprecated: true })` from `@nestjs/swagger` for OpenAPI documentation

```ts
// /presentation/foobar.controller.ts
@Controller("foobars")
export class FooBarController {
  // ✅ GOOD - RFC 9745 Deprecation header + RFC 8594 Sunset header + OpenAPI deprecated flag
  @Get('foo')
  @Header("Deprecation", "@1688169599") // RFC 9745 format: when this endpoint was deprecated
  @Header("Sunset", "Sun, 30 Jun 2024 23:59:59 UTC") // RFC 8594 format: when this endpoint will removed
  @ApiOperation({
    summary: "List all foo bar qux",
    deprecated: true, // <- flag
  })
  @ApiOkResponse({ type: PaginatedWorkCenterResponseDTO })
  async getFoobar() {
    // ...
  }

  // ❌ BAD - missing RFC headers, only OpenAPI deprecated flag
  @Get('bar')
  @ApiOperation({
    summary: "List all foo bar qux",
    deprecated: true,
  })
  @ApiOkResponse({ type: PaginatedWorkCenterResponseDTO })
  async getFoobar() {
    // ...
  }
}
```